{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>That which shall befall you.</b> The things destined to come upon you — but they are not blessings, for we do not find that he blessed Reuben, Simeon, and Levi. And what is written, ״וזאת אשר דבר להם אביהם״ — this is what we have said: this is what he spoke to them, and afterwards he blessed them, but it does not explain with what he blessed them." "<b>In the end of the days.</b> It does not say ימים but <b>הימים</b> — they are already made clear, for HaShem fixed for Abraham their grandfather a set time of servitude of four hundred years in the covenant between the pieces."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:07.607744486Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}